# OpenAPI/Swagger Endpoints
###############################################################################

### Get OpenAPI v1 specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Get OpenAPI v2 specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v2.json
Accept: application/json

### Swagger UI (interactive documentation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger
